        "title": "Vue 3 · Tailwind",
        "code": "<!-- Nota.vue -->\n<template>\n  <div :class=\"[\n    'flex flex-col gap-2 px-3 py-4 rounded-md border min-w-[460px]',\n    tipo === 'conversacion'\n      ? 'bg-[var(--note-conversacion-bg)] border-[var(--note-conversacion-border)]'\n      : 'bg-[var(--note-contacto-bg)] border-[var(--note-contacto-border)]'\n  ]\">\n    <p :class=\"['text-body-md-medium', tipo === 'conversacion' ? 'text-[var(--note-conversacion-text)]' : 'text-[var(--note-contacto-text)]']\">{{ autor }}</p>\n    <p class=\"text-body-md text-[var(--text-primary)]\">{{ texto }}</p>\n    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-body-xxs-bold\">\n      <span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Origen: {{ origen }}</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[var(--text-tertiary)]\">{{ fecha }}</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\ndefineProps({\n  tipo:   { type: String, default: 'conversacion' }, // 'conversacion' | 'contacto'\n  autor:  { type: String, required: true },\n  texto:  { type: String, required: true },\n  origen: { type: String, required: true },\n  fecha:  { type: String, required: true },\n})\n</script>\n\n<!-- gap-2 = spacing/2 · px-3 = spacing/3 · py-4 = spacing/4 · rounded-md = radius/md -->"
